### Contoh request untuk REST Client (VS Code). Lengkapi sambil Anda membangun endpoint.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### POST   {{base}}/api/auth/register
### POST   {{base}}/api/auth/login
### POST   {{base}}/api/auth/refresh
### GET    {{base}}/api/products?limit=10
### GET    {{base}}/api/sales
### POST   {{base}}/api/sales/:id/orders      (header: Authorization, Idempotency-Key)
### GET    {{base}}/api/orders/:id
### GET    {{base}}/health   /ready   /metrics
